{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31323","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 四 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 四丈夫同赋 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新荆棘路旧衡门，又驻高车会一尊。\n寒骨未沾新雨露，春风不长败兰荪。\n丹诚岂分埋幽壤，白日终希照覆盆。\n珍重昔年金谷友，共来泉际话幽魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}